<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-Nov budget deficit hits SKK 13.742 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-Nov budget deficit hits SKK 13.742 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's state budget deficit widened to 13.742 billion crowns for the January- November period of 1996, from 12.9 billion crowns for the first 10 months of the year, the finance ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
